      "text": "CH<sub>2</sub><sub>&nbsp;</sub>=​&nbsp;CH&nbsp;-&nbsp;CH<sub>2</sub>&nbsp;- Br +&nbsp;C<sub>6</sub>H<sub>5</sub>ONa",
